  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe top right corner in the Home Tab of the Launcher App is supposed to show your Profile Icon. Currently it's not correctly behaving, as even if you have a VRC+ Profile Icon set, it still shows your Profile Picture / Avatar Thumbnail.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe Icon shown should follow a set hierarchy, just like it does every where else:\n\nVRC+ Profile Icon > VRC+ Profile Picture > Avatar Thumbnail\n\n# Attachments:\n\nThe first picture show cases my Profile Icon and Picture and the second one showcases the image currently used in the Home Tab:",
